/* Bootstrap placeholder: recompui::init_styling (lib/RecompFrontend/recompui/src/core/ui_context.cpp)
 * hard-requires this file to exist -- if it's missing, std::ifstream opens in a failed state,
 * tellg() returns -1 on that failed stream, and resize() receives that -1 implicitly converted to
 * a huge size_t, throwing std::length_error (see STATUS.md round 35). An empty stylesheet is valid
 * RCSS and merges cleanly with recompui's own base styling, so this is a safe placeholder -- it is
 * not this game's real UI styling, which doesn't exist yet (no assets extracted from the ROM).
 */
